WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Hi, I am Pradeep Kantpal, Founder and Director of Ecostar Innovation.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Today, we are talking about Urja Mobility.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.500
My association with Urja Mobility started in 2023. 

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.000
It has been approximately 3 years now, and I have done a lot of good work with them.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The commitment and working style of the Urja Mobility team is exceptional. I have seen this level of commitment in very few companies.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.500
As work progresses, people change, but the discipline of their team has remained incredibly strong.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:50.000
As far as their coordination with my team is concerned, my team has never had any complaints. Their professional behavior is excellent.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Similarly, regarding orders, they pick them up exactly as promised. It has never happened that they placed an order and failed to collect it.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:13.000
On a personal level, I interact with Anand ji and Roshan ji. Both are very good, highly supportive, and we help each other out whenever needed.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:22.000
From what I understand, their core work involves battery leasing, battery swapping, and battery financing.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.000
They are operating all over India, working in almost all major cities across the country.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:45.000
During my visits, I found their operations running in West Bengal, Jaipur, Uttar Pradesh, and Meerut. Overall, they are covering a massive footprint in India with battery financing.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:02.000
By my estimation, they have likely successfully financed 10,000 to 15,000 batteries so far.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:15.000
I have personally visited their offices—one in NSP, Delhi, and another near Signature Tower in Gurgaon. They operate their major functions from there.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:22.000
They also have a dedicated testing lab where they thoroughly test and evaluate the batteries beforehand.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Overall, if someone asks for my personal view, I would give them a 10 out of 10 rating.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.000
My experience with the Urja Mobility team has been outstanding. Thank you.